Hidden seers praise meeting and envy dialogue --- Seers seeking Rāvaṇa death bid Bharata free father through Rāma --- Gandharvas and royal seers depart to own abodes --- Bharata pleads he cannot guard kingdom or win people --- Bharata falls at feet as kin yearn like farmers for rain --- Rāma calls Bharata capable, bids counsel ministers, vows keeping promise --- Rāma bids Bharata honour mother without resentment --- Rāma wears gold sandals and gives them to Bharata --- Bharata circles Rāma and sets sandals on elephant head --- Rāma dismisses all, greets mothers, enters hut weeping
